              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " noogira oti: Imwe bagabe ba Yuda 'mwe n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyareeta akabi omuri ogu mwanya, akarireetera amatu g'orikahurira weena kuteera enduuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.1.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 1:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'abantu kuunyimuura, bakahagara ogu mwanya nibagusiisisa okugwotereramu baaruhanga abandi obubaane, abu batakamanyaga n'obu baakuba baishenkurubo nari abagabe ba Yuda, n'okugwijuza eshagama y'abataine rubanja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
