            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " n'okwombekyera Baali emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, okurabizamu batabani baabo omu mruriro kuba ebitambo by'okwotsya by'okutambira Baali, ebi ntararagiire n'obu kwakuba okutaho, kandi ebitakaijaga mu biteekateeko byangye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ahabw'ekyo, reeba, obunaku buryaija, obu ogu mwanya gutarigaruka kwetwa ogwa Tofeti, n'obu rwakuba oruhanga rwa mwene Hinoomu, kureka guryayetwa oruhanga rw'eiriitiro; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 26:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.19.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 19:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi omuri ogu mwanya enaama za Yuda na Yerusaalemu nimwo ndizicwera busha, nkareetera abantu baabo kwitirwa omu maisho g'abazigu baabo bakaitwa abarikubahiiga. Kandi emitumbi yaabo ndyagigaburira amahungu g'omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.18.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 18:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi orurembo ndyaruhindura ekirikutiinisa n'eky'okweshaanya, orirurabaho weena ashishwe, ayeshaanye ahabw'akabi koona aku rwareebire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
