          "text": " Amaju ga Yerusaalemu na zaanyaruju z'abagabe ba Yuda biryahagarwa nk'ogwo mwanya gwa Tofeti; nigo maju goona agaabaire nigookyezibwaho obubaane nibooterera eihe ryona ery'omu iguru, bakashukiriraho baaruhanga abandi empongano z'eby'okunywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
